3
00:00:26,460 --> 00:00:36,680
If an anomaly occurs or an API behaves unexpectedly, you can replay the exact execution history step-by-step to diagnose the precise mathematical root cause.

4
00:00:37,580 --> 00:00:45,240
This audit trail can be exported as a verified JSONL log for SOC2, HIPAA, and enterprise legal compliance reviews.

5
00:00:46,140 --> 00:00:56,240
In regulated industries like healthcare, banking, and government defense, having mathematically verifiable execution proof is an absolute legal prerequisite.

6
00:00:57,140 --> 00:01:01,896
Cryptographic transparency is the foundation of institutional trust.

7
00:01:01,896 --> 00:01:09,240
When your systems are fully auditable, you build unshakeable confidence with your users and stakeholders.

